    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head Collector VR is a fun action game that combines spells, stunning character visuals, and thrilling combat with full physical interaction with enemies. In this game, you can grab and stab enemies, throw them away, stop time, turn into a giant, create dozens of rotating blades that can chop anything apart, and hang enemies up in the air to enjoy their desperation.  While the hack and slash components can be played without VR, the game is much more fun with a VR headset, offering an exciting, fun experience where you have the power to shape your own world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells: Dash, Fire, Ice, Poison, Slow, Faint,\u00a0Magic Shackles, Strip, Time Stop,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant,\u00a0Cyclone Blade,\u00a0<strong>Levitation,\u00a0</strong>Dance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/fad7ecb3fd567a1a2ec84ad79a8dca1f.poster.avif?t=1734780654\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/fad7ecb3fd567a1a2ec84ad79a8dca1f.webm?t=1734780654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/fad7ecb3fd567a1a2ec84ad79a8dca1f.mp4?t=1734780654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/c213f7e23438b7143469aaab02ad5c5f.poster.avif?t=1734780654\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https: