/2983780/extras/573e926f9d832144e493a8f0caf0434a.mp4?t=1734780654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Mode:\u00a0Attack, Defend,\u00a0Execution,\u00a0Armor,\u00a0Headshot,\u00a0Giant</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head Collector VR is playable without VR. You can play with it like a normal game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/172c7c252e6bd0dab208649214be0fe2.poster.avif?t=1734780654\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/172c7c252e6bd0dab208649214be0fe2.webm?t=1734780654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983780/extras/172c7c252e6bd0dab208649214be0fe2.mp4?t=1734780654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons: Bow, Crossbow, Pistol, Musket, Rocket Launcher, Swords, Daggers, Guillotine, Pillory, Mirror, Gallows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps:\u00a0Empty, Village, Greenland, Greenmeadows,\u00a0Mountain Valley,\u00a0Graveyard, Wind Haven, First Village</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
